$------------------------------------------------------------------------

$ newer Z-phase assessment by Hilmar Danielsen from 2006-11-01

$------------------------------------------------------------------------

 PHASE ZET %  3 1   1   1 ! 

$Cr-Fe-Nb-V-Mo nitride. Important precipitate in austenitic stainless steels. 

$Also found in 9-12 mass.% Cr-steels after prolonged exposure to temperatures 

$close to service temperatures. 

